        "country_code": "ua",
        "front_dist_km": null,
        "text": "Mashovets reported that Ukrainian forces advanced along the Stepnohirsk – Plavni (west of Orikhiv) vector and that Russian forces attempted unsuccessfully to counterattack with infiltrators in southern Stepnohirsk and southern Prymorske.[84] Mashovets assessed that the Russian military command in this area is worried about its increasingly difficult situation as Ukrainian forces attack toward Kamyanske.",
